<div id="2026-10-30-invoice-same-product" class="cl-entry">
<h3>2026-10-30 — Chat invoice asks when the item belongs to another supplier</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> A name match no longer auto-links an item sold by a different supplier. The chat asks whether it is the same product, and offers a new item for this supplier plus an editable unit cost. Stock and catalog price change only when the draft is Posted. A repeat of the same invoice number returns the existing invoice.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> Caroline’s salsa was linked to the co-op salsa because the names matched. A second draft was created because earlier drafts had no invoice number.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>Model/AI2/InvoiceCreate.pm</code>, <code>Controller/Inventory.pm</code>, <code>root/static/js/ai-chat/feature-invoice.js</code></p>
</div>
